    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Arrays</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Prefix sum + first index</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/contiguous-array/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 525</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Contiguous Array</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Count a 0 as -1 and a 1 as +1: a stretch with equal 0s and 1s is a stretch whose running balance ends where it started. Remember the first index of every balance and measure from it. O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
